      <h1 id="templates-using-ruby-on-rails" class="group scroll-mt-20">Creating applications using Ruby on Rails<a href="#templates-using-ruby-on-rails" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h1>
